 'ratio','medium','scripts/q4_chem_table.py, q4_ch3oh_maser.py, q4_ch3oh_blend.py; /snapshots/team-b-s01/out/s21_ch3oh254.json, s22_ch3oh_lte_ratio.json (read)','N, S, Bridge',
